1
00:00:40,119 --> 00:00:41,079
Miss

2
00:01:02,439 --> 00:01:03,880
You said her face looked terrible.

3
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,439
Yeah.

4
00:01:04,799 --> 00:01:06,400
Describe exactly how it looked.

5
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,120
Bluish.

6
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,159
No...

7
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,359
maybe with a hint of purple in it.

8
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,799
I can't really explain the color.

9
00:01:17,799 --> 00:01:19,359
Anyway, it was between blue and purple.

10
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:21,760
It was terrifying.

11
00:01:30,959 --> 00:01:32,159
That's a very precise description.

12
00:01:33,079 --> 00:01:34,879
If he had just strangled her,

13
00:01:35,239 --> 00:01:37,400
he wouldn't notice the subtle shift to purple and blue.

14
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:40,079
When recounting his experience at the scene,

15
00:01:40,079 --> 00:01:41,640
he spoke in fragmented, plain language.

16
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:42,920
Full of emotion,

17
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:43,879
with accurate details.

18
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,200
He wasn't lying.

19
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,799
Did you notice

20
00:01:47,959 --> 00:01:49,280
the photos of Wu Qimeng's hands?

21
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,400
Wu Qimeng's hands?

22
00:01:54,959 --> 00:01:56,040
The hands aren't the point.

23
00:01:56,359 --> 00:01:57,599
It's what's under her fingernails.

24
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:59,239
I recall the ME said they were clean.

25
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,120
No skin tissue was found beneath them.

26
00:02:02,799 --> 00:02:05,000
Yang Xiaotian got the text at 8:40,

27
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:07,560
headed over to Wu Qimeng's place,

28
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,840
talked to himself until finding the body,

29
00:02:10,319 --> 00:02:11,800
and quickly fled the scene.

30
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,280
This aligns with the 8:50 surveillance

31
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,800
showing him flee the compound.

32
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,479
If Yang Xiaotian were the killer,

33
00:02:17,719 --> 00:02:19,400
he wouldn't have had time to thoroughly

34
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,199
clean the skin tissue from under her nails.

35
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:23,400
Yang Xiaotian really didn't kill her.

36
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:25,240
*Sighs*

37
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:27,360
So after running around in circles,

38
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:29,599
we're right back to square one.

39
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,719
Not necessarily.

40
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,159
What's the situation?

41
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,919
I looked into everything.

42
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,319
What did you investigate?

43
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:50,159
The boss had me check on the victim's husband,

44
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,919
asking around at Li Changyu's company.

45
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,520
Turns out that Li Changyu

46
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,159
is just an ordinary department manager.

47
00:02:55,439 --> 00:02:57,439
He came from a very poor family.

48
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,240
He was Wu Qimeng's college classmate.

49
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:02,120
They dated for many years

50
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:04,360
before finally tying the knot.

51
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,879
Wu Qimeng is an heiress,

52
00:03:06,719 --> 00:03:09,520
so this marriage of unequal status

53
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:11,439
at Li Changyu's company

54
00:03:11,639 --> 00:03:12,800
has long been no secret,

55
00:03:13,039 --> 00:03:14,240
known to almost everyone.

56
00:03:14,719 --> 00:03:16,759
Seems Wu Qimeng's family is indeed wealthy.

57
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,560
Wu Qimeng's parents

58
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,479
are in the biopharmaceutical business,

59
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:23,319
making them extremely wealthy.

60
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,439
The nanny also said

61
00:03:25,719 --> 00:03:27,680
she's worked for them for four months,

62
00:03:28,199 --> 00:03:29,960
and the couple got along very well.

63
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:32,000
Especially the husband, Li Changyu,

64
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:34,319
who really doted on his wife.

65
00:03:34,439 --> 00:03:35,800
No matter what tantrum she threw,

66
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,199
he'd always soothe her.

67
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:41,439
You suspect Li Changyu?

68
00:03:41,639 --> 00:03:44,319
To plan the timeline so meticulously,

69
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:46,120
and even frame someone else,

70
00:03:46,879 --> 00:03:48,919
requires high intelligence and careful thought.

71
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,759
What's more, to effortlessly

72
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:52,479
break in and kill a pregnant woman

73
00:03:52,479 --> 00:03:54,599
shows this person is not only an acquaintance,

74
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,879
but also a strong young man.

75
00:03:57,759 --> 00:03:59,080
Everything so far indicates

76
00:03:59,439 --> 00:04:01,360
the one who best fits the criminal profile

77
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,120
is

78
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,520
a young and promising

79
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:04,960
corporate executive,

80
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:07,280
the victim's husband, Li Changyu.

81
00:04:07,479 --> 00:04:09,120
But he has an alibi.

82
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,719
At 8:40,

83
00:04:10,919 --> 00:04:12,400
he was already on the plane.

84
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,599
When Wang Lili left at 8:30,

85
00:04:14,599 --> 00:04:15,840
she said the victim was still fine.

86
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,560
Yang Xiaotian didn't lie.

87
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:20,519
The condition of the body he saw proves

88
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,160
Wu Qimeng had been dead for some time.

89
00:04:23,399 --> 00:04:24,240
Otherwise,

90
00:04:24,439 --> 00:04:26,319
the body wouldn't have purplish bruising.

91
00:04:26,959 --> 00:04:28,399
That means at 8:30,

92
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,360
she was already dead.

93
00:04:31,319 --> 00:04:32,639
Wang Lili lied.

94
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:36,759
The best friend, the nanny, the husband...

95
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:39,120
It's time to dig into their finances

96
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,759
and relationships, these sensitive areas,

97
00:04:40,759 --> 00:04:42,279
for a thorough investigation.

98
00:04:42,279 --> 00:04:44,199
I'll start investigating Wang Lili.

99
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,160
Help me get clearance for the crime scene.

100
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,959
I want to go and take a look.

101
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:51,160
All right, be careful on the way.

102
00:04:51,399 --> 00:04:52,240
Stay safe.

103
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,120
I'll drive.

104
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,759
Don't stare directly into the sunlight.

105
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,399
There are two things that cannot be looked at directly:

106
00:05:28,879 --> 00:05:30,040
one is the sun,

107
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:32,480
and the other is the human heart.

108
00:05:35,519 --> 00:05:36,319
Let's go.

109
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:43,439
Captain, it's only been three days.

110
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:44,800
Why do I feel like Shen Yu

111
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,199
is growing on you more and more?

112
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,439
Well,

113
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,600
I thought he was just an aloof,

114
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,040
idle, and good-for-nothing

115
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,720
rich playboy.

116
00:05:53,199 --> 00:05:55,519
Now I see he actually has real skill.

117
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,600
As the heir of Ancheng's Shen family,

118
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,680
how bad could he possibly be?

119
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,480
Still, keeping him around Yan

120
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,680
is just too dangerous.

121
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:04,240
In elite families like that,

122
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,120
interests always come first.

123
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,920
Who knows how much infighting goes on?

124
00:06:07,199 --> 00:06:09,439
Otherwise, his brother wouldn't be tied to a murder.

125
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,360
And it even dragged down...

126
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,279
You, honestly...

127
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:14,000
In front of the two of them,

128
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,959
don't bring up that past serial murder case.

129
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:34,120
Why did we have to come at night?

130
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:36,319
It's got quite an eerie vibe, doesn't it?

131
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:37,959
Time is tight.

132
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:40,120
Wu Qimeng died at night.

133
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,439
By coming at night,

134
00:06:41,519 --> 00:06:42,680
we might spot clues

135
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,879
easily missed during the day.

136
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,639
Wu Qimeng was from a wealthy family,

137
00:06:50,439 --> 00:06:51,839
yet the couple

138
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:53,600
lived in a small hundred-square-meter apartment.

139
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:56,680
Li Changyu bought this place with a mortgage.

140
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:59,600
Even though Li Changyu

141
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,560
is a department manager at a private firm

142
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,879
making 400,000 a year,

143
00:07:02,879 --> 00:07:04,519
compared to regular folks,

144
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,199
he makes quite a lot.

145
00:07:06,879 --> 00:07:09,000
But compared to Wu Qimeng's family,

146
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:11,319
who make tens or hundreds of millions

147
00:07:11,319 --> 00:07:12,920
in business profits every year,

148
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:15,000
it's practically nothing.

149
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:18,160
Looks like Wu Qimeng's parents

150
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,759
didn't approve of this marriage.

151
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,519
That's right.

152
00:07:21,839 --> 00:07:23,199
Yet Wu Qimeng

153
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:25,000
insisted on marrying Li Changyu anyway.

154
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:26,360
After the wedding,

155
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,879
Wu Qimeng's parents

156
00:07:28,079 --> 00:07:29,600
completely cut off all

157
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:31,120
financial support and contact.

158
00:07:31,639 --> 00:07:32,839
A self-made top student

159
00:07:32,839 --> 00:07:35,240
marries a rich heiress.

160
00:07:35,759 --> 00:07:37,079
He might have joined his wife's

161
00:07:37,079 --> 00:07:38,160
family business

162
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:41,240
and risen fast using his father-in-law's wealth,

163
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,720
only to end up with nothing.

164
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,560
Don't underestimate how ruthless

165
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,959
families like that can be.

166
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:53,920
Besides, Wu Qimeng wasn't an only child.

167
00:07:53,959 --> 00:07:55,279
She has a younger brother.

168
00:07:55,879 --> 00:07:58,040
So Li Changyu wasn't even qualified

169
00:07:58,319 --> 00:08:00,279
to be a live-in son-in-law.

170
00:08:13,319 --> 00:08:14,959
Wu Qimeng's body

171
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:16,759
was found on the bed.

172
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,720
When the nanny opened the door this morning,

173
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:21,160
she saw Wu Qimeng lying on the bed,

174
00:08:21,759 --> 00:08:22,959
completely motionless.

175
00:08:28,759 --> 00:08:30,000
What awful weather.

176
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,519
Hey, don't touch anything!

177
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,759
You'll contaminate the crime scene.

178
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:39,879
It's too stuffy.

179
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,559
I'm just turning on the AC.

180
00:08:42,879 --> 00:08:44,440
It won't ruin anything.

181
00:09:14,799 --> 00:09:16,720
Why is this AC leaking water?

182
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:19,840
You really are a pampered young master.

183
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:22,080
That's condensation from the AC cooling.

184
00:09:22,519 --> 00:09:23,799
Even at normal temperatures,

185
00:09:23,799 --> 00:09:25,200
a drop or two will still drip down.

186
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,799
Just don't stand right there.

187
00:09:27,559 --> 00:09:28,360
Oh.

188
00:09:29,519 --> 00:09:31,639
Then the lower the AC temperature,

189
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,679
the more condensation there is?

190
00:09:35,039 --> 00:09:36,120
That's right.

191
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,559
The lower the AC temperature,

192
00:09:37,679 --> 00:09:38,759
the more condensation...

193
00:09:41,879 --> 00:09:43,279
Is something wrong?

194
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:17,440
It's dried condensation stains.

195
00:10:17,799 --> 00:10:18,879
It's autumn right now.

196
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,159
The nighttime temperature

197
00:10:20,159 --> 00:10:22,080
is between 25 and 27 degrees Celsius.

198
00:10:22,519 --> 00:10:24,679
Any condensation would evaporate quickly.

199
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:27,559
Unless the AC was set extremely low,

200
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,200
causing condensation to drip faster

201
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,639
and leave stains before it could evaporate.

202
00:10:34,879 --> 00:10:35,679
So,

203
00:10:36,559 --> 00:10:38,759
someone might've deliberately lowered the temperature

204
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:41,600
to disrupt the ME's time of death estimate.
